+    <div class="state-table level-directory">
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="age-reversal/level-01.html">Level 01 / The File</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="age-reversal/level-01.html" aria-label="Open Level 01">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="age-reversal/level-02.html">Level 02 / Recognition</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="age-reversal/level-02.html" aria-label="Open Level 02">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="age-reversal/level-03.html">Level 03 / The Override</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="age-reversal/level-03.html" aria-label="Open Level 03">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="age-reversal/level-04.html">Level 04 / Daily Operation</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="age-reversal/level-04.html" aria-label="Open Level 04">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="age-reversal/level-05.html">Level 05 / The Seal</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="age-reversal/level-05.html" aria-label="Open Level 05">Open</a></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Structure</p>
+    <h2>How the Sequence Runs</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The Age Reversal Protocol treats aging as a configuration, not a fact. Each level revokes one layer of the inherited file and replaces it with operator-issued instruction. One level per day. Each level seals before the next opens.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Levels</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list">
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Level 01</strong><span>The File. Identifying the configuration that runs aging.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Level 02</strong><span>Recognition. Exposing the inherited code.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Level 03</strong><span>The Override. Revoking the file at the operator layer.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Level 04</strong><span>Daily Operation. Holding the new file in place.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Level 05</strong><span>The Seal. Operating in younger time.</span></div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
