+  </nav>
+</header>
+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Level 01 / The File</p>
+    <h1>The File</h1>
+    <p class="lede">You have been told the wrong story about aging. The body is not aging on its own. The body is rendering instructions.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../age-reversal.html">Age Reversal</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Transmission</p>
+    <h2>Level 01 — The File</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Level one of five. Identifying the configuration that runs aging.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Age Reversal — Level 01</p>
+      <video controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/video/age-reversal/level-01.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
+      </video>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Diagnosis Sequence</h2>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Observe</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>The body is rendering instructions. It gets the instructions from the identity file you are running.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Diagnose</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>The cells do not check the calendar. They receive identity broadcasts and render the configuration the broadcast describes.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Identify</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>You have been running an aging file. The body is executing the configuration. There is nothing wrong with the body.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Level 01 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Age File</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Identified</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>The Mechanism</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The world sells aging as biological, linear, inevitable. Time eats the body, skin loses, energy drops — everyone on the same elevator going down. This is not what is happening.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>How It Actually Runs</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Body</strong><span>Has no opinion about how old you are.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Cells</strong><span>Do not check the calendar. They render identity broadcasts.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>File</strong><span>You did not write the aging file. You inherited it from culture, family, media.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Render</strong><span>Until you revoke the file, the body continues rendering it.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>The Next Four Levels</h3>
+      <p>The next four levels show you how to revoke it. Level 02 exposes the file. Level 03 issues the override. Level 04 holds it. Level 05 seals it.</p>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <nav class="prev-next-nav" aria-label="Day navigation">
