+</header>
+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Level 02 / Recognition</p>
+    <h1>Recognition</h1>
+    <p class="lede">The aging file is almost entirely inherited code — written before you could question it. To revoke it, you must first see it.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../age-reversal.html">Age Reversal</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Transmission</p>
+    <h2>Level 02 — Recognition</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Level two of five. Exposing the inherited code.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Age Reversal — Level 02</p>
+      <video controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/video/age-reversal/level-02.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
+      </video>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Recognition Sequence</h2>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Cultural Code</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every story about what each decade is supposed to feel like. The 30s as decline. The 40s as slowdown. None of this is biology. All of it is cultural code pretending to be facts.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Family Code</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Whatever was believed about her body at your age — installed. Whatever was said about getting older — installed. You absorbed the entire family's relationship with aging before you knew you were absorbing anything.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Media Code</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every magazine. Every before-and-after. Every product that sold you on what you would soon need to fix. The industry is structured around aging so the products become necessary.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">04</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Comparison Code</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Whatever you decided was the reference point for your age — installed. The friends who started looking older — installed. By the time you became conscious of having a relationship with aging, the file was running on factory settings.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Level 02 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Age File</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Opened</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>Instructions, Not Observations</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The sentences currently running in the file sound like observations. They are not. They are instructions. The body reads them as commands and renders accordingly.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Sentences That Are Commands</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>I am ___ years old.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>My body responds slower than it used to.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>My skin is showing my age.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I don't have the energy I used to have.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>This is what this age looks like.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I need to accept this is happening.</strong><span>Instruction.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>The Shift</h3>
+      <p>Recognition is the operation. The moment you see that the aging file exists and is running, the file is exposed. It has been the loudest broadcast in your system for as long as you can remember. You simply weren't reading it as code.</p><p>The aging file is no longer disguised as reality, biology, or just getting older. It is now visible as a configuration. And configurations can be changed.</p>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <nav class="prev-next-nav" aria-label="Day navigation">
+    <a href="level-01.html">Level 01</a>
+    <a href="../age-reversal.html">Age Reversal</a>
+    <a href="level-03.html">Level 03</a>
+  </nav>
+</main>
+<footer class="footer">The Protocol / Utility Console</footer>
+<script src="../wormhole-lab.js"></script>
