+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Level 03 / The Override</p>
+    <h1>The Override</h1>
+    <p class="lede">The file is exposed. Today you revoke it. The override is an authorization issued from operator authority and received by the cells as new instruction.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../age-reversal.html">Age Reversal</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Transmission</p>
+    <h2>Level 03 — The Override</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Level three of five. The reversal sequence.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Age Reversal — Level 03</p>
+      <video controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/video/age-reversal/level-03.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
+      </video>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Command</p>
+    <h2>Reversal Sequence</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Say it out loud. Each line is an authorization. The cells receive each line and update their configuration.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>I am revoking the age file.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>My body does not age. My body renders identity.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>I am young.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">04</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>I am reversing.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">05</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>My skin renews. My energy rises. My body renders younger.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">06</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>Time bends to identity in my field.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">07</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Execute</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>The reversal is active. The reversal is permanent.</code></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Sequence Complete</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Render</span><span class="status-value status-active">Updating</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Override</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Active</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>How the Override Lands</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The cells receive the transmission only when the sentence leaves the body. The render updates continuously beneath visibility, building toward the surface.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>First Signals</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Within 48 hours</strong><span>Skin tone. Sleep depth. Energy in the body before coffee. Faces in the mirror that look slightly different.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Within two weeks</strong><span>Other people begin commenting. <em>You look different. Did you change something?</em> They are reading the new broadcast.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Why Most Reversal Protocols Fail</h3>
+      <p>They target the body without revoking the file. The supplement works at the cellular layer, but the identity transmits at the broadcast layer — and the broadcast overrides the supplement every time.</p><p>You revoke the file first. Every intervention you choose from here — sleep, sun, water, supplement, strength — lands on top of a body that is no longer instructed to age. The override is the foundation. Today it is installed.</p>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
