+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Level 04 / Daily Operation</p>
+    <h1>Daily Operation</h1>
+    <p class="lede">The override is live and stays live unless you reinstall the old file. Most people reinstall it by accident the next morning.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../age-reversal.html">Age Reversal</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Transmission</p>
+    <h2>Level 04 — Daily Operation</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Level four of five. Holding the new file in place.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Age Reversal — Level 04</p>
+      <video controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/video/age-reversal/level-04.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
+      </video>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Command</p>
+    <h2>Daily Reversal Operation</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Sixty seconds every morning in front of a mirror. Before anyone else&#x27;s broadcast enters your field, you say it louder.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>I am operating in a body that does not age.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>My cells renew. My skin renews. My body renews.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>I am young. I am fit. I am strong. My energy runs high.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">04</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>My body ages back.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">05</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>Every year my body operates younger.</code></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">06</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Speak</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><code>My body answers to my identity, not my age.</code></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Sequence Complete</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Render</span><span class="status-value status-active">Stabilized</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Firewall</p>
+    <h2>What Stops Starting Now</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The first voice your system receives each day is the one it takes as operating instruction. Make yours the first.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Stops Now</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Announcing your age unnecessarily.</strong><span>Each mention is a transmission.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>"At my age…"</strong><span>Instruction to the cells.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Calling yourself old as a joke.</strong><span>The cells do not understand jokes. They execute the broadcast.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Conversations where people compete over the climb.</strong><span>Each line of that conversation is a re-install.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>What It Means</h3>
+      <p>You are simply not transmitting the old file anymore.</p>
+    </div>
+  </section>
