+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>In five levels the file changed. Each level closed a door the old file was leaving open. The last one closes today.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Integration</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Skin</strong><span>Updates faster than people expect.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Energy</strong><span>Stabilizes.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Sleep</strong><span>Deepens.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Recovery</strong><span>Sharpens.</span></div></div><p>You do not push for any of this. The cells have new instructions. They execute whether or not you watch. Most operators stop checking after week three because the changes have become normal.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>The Hold</h3>
+      <p>The protocol holds unless you reinstall the old file yourself. You are not the same operator anymore. You are now operating in younger time. The body is rendering accordingly.</p>
