+    <a href="wormhole.html" class="is-active">Wormhole</a>
+    <a href="age-reversal.html" class="">Age Reversal</a>
+    <a href="custom.html" class="">Custom</a>
+    <a href="bank.html" class="">Bank</a>
+  </nav>
+</header>
+<main class="shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Six-Day Sequence</p>
+    <h1>Wormhole</h1>
+    <p class="lede">Synchronized identity install. Day 1 is the entry. Day 6 is the seal. Run them in order.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="wormhole/day-01.html">Begin Day 01</a><a href="index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel state-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Day Map</p>
+    <div class="state-table level-directory">
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-01.html">Day 01 / The Entry</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-01.html" aria-label="Open Day 01">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-02.html">Day 02 / Proof of Identity</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-02.html" aria-label="Open Day 02">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-03.html">Day 03 / Decide From the File</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-03.html" aria-label="Open Day 03">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-04.html">Day 04 / Field Operations</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-04.html" aria-label="Open Day 04">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-05.html">Day 05 / Already Done</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-05.html" aria-label="Open Day 05">Open</a></div>
+      <div class="state-row"><a class="state-label state-label--link" href="wormhole/day-06.html">Day 06 / Operating From Source</a><a class="utility-link utility-link--open" href="wormhole/day-06.html" aria-label="Open Day 06">Open</a></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">How it runs</p>
+    <h2>Daily Rhythm</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>Each day carries the same skeleton: a written protocol, a morning activation, an evening activation, a daily card. Run the morning activation in the morning. Run the operations across the day. Run the evening activation to seal.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Components</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list">
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Protocol</strong><span>The day's three operations. The operational layer.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Morning Activation</strong><span>Audio transmission to enter the day.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Evening Activation</strong><span>Audio transmission to seal the day.</span></div>
+        <div class="flat-row"><strong>Daily Card</strong><span>PDF reference card for the day.</span></div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+</main>
