+    <p class="lede">Synchronized global pickup. The moment the Wormhole opens.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>First Contact — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Run them in sequence today. The first hours after the live are not preparation. They are operation.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">First Decision</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>The first decision you make today after the live — any decision, no matter how small — make it as the new character.</span><span>Within two hours of the live ending. Note the decision. Note that the new file was running when you made it.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">First Mirror</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Stand in front of a mirror. Speak one sentence out loud about who you are now.</span><span>Not an affirmation. A statement of fact. Hold your own gaze while you say it. Once. No repetition.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">First Redirect</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>The first moment today that hands you an old trigger — register it as data and operate as the new character anyway.</span><span>Say <code>access denied</code> and continue. The old trigger does not land.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 01 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Operator</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Inside The Wormhole</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>What Day 01 Is</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>This first live is not about learning something new. It is about entering. About recognizing what you are, what you are not, and what stops getting a vote from this point forward.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Access Event</h3>
+      <p>You do not come here to get ready. You do not come here to slowly become. You come here to enter.</p><p>Day 1 is not the start of a process. It is the point of decision. The new character is not introduced here. The new character is installed. From this moment on, the transit is live.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>What Shifts</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Floor</strong><span>The floor changes.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Old System</strong><span>Stops being the one in charge.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>File</strong><span>Switches at the source.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Timeline</strong><span>Begins to bend.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>The First Install</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Day 1 seals as a file switch, not as a soft ending. The version of you who woke up this morning is not the one going to sleep tonight.</p><p>Let the transmission do its work. No processing. No effort. Just receive the lock and let the body learn what is true now.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 01 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-01-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Transmission</p>
+    <h2>I AM — Operator Declarations</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>Source, render, fact, conviction. The Day 01 broadcast wall — operator declarations spoken into the field.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Declarations</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>the Source.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>the one from which everything renders.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>the conscious creator. Reality is my screen.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>the source that commands reality at her will.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>conviction itself.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>source — what I command renders in my reality.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>I AM</strong><span>the operator of my own life.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <p>Download the Day 01 daily card for offline reference.</p><div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-01-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <nav class="prev-next-nav" aria-label="Day navigation">
+    <a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a>
+    <a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a>
+    <a href="day-02.html">Day 02</a>
