+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Day 02 / Proof of Identity</p>
+    <h1>Proof of Identity</h1>
+    <p class="lede">The first full day of running the new file. You do not wait for proof. You operate to produce proof.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Proof of Identity — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">The DENIED command activates today. Same skeleton: command, broadcast, log.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Denied</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every time an old reflex tries to fire — old worry, old comparison, old doubt, old shrinking — you run the command internally.</span><span><code>OLD FILE — DENIED. NEW FILE — RUNNING.</code></span><span>Mechanical. Like a firewall response. The reflex tried to deliver. The system denied it. Move on.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Broadcast</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Three times today — morning, midday, evening — speak three lines out loud.</span><span><code>I am the new file. / I am running. / The render is updating now.</code></span><span>Said as fact, not affirmation. Thirty seconds. Three times.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Log</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>By the end of Day 2, collect five micro-proofs — small moments where the new character was running.</span><span>A decision made in 30 seconds instead of spiraling. A held voice. A no without justification. A yes without hedging. A field shift. Format does not matter. Collection does.</span><span>Five proofs. Logged by bedtime.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 02 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Command</span><span class="status-value status-complete">DENIED Running</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Morning Activation</p>
+    <h2>Operate Before Proof Arrives</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Listen from the chair of the new character. Today is about proof of identity — in small, real decisions that show the file is already live.</p><p>You are not waiting for proof to start operating. You are operating in order to produce proof.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 02 — Morning Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-02-morning-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>Sealing the Proof</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Tonight is about sealing proof. The body learns through what was actually done, denied, and chosen today.</p><p>Every moment the old reflex was refused and the new file kept running becomes identity data now.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 02 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-02-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>The Three Switches</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The architecture seals what was produced. The same three switches from Day 01, locked deeper now that there is proof to seal them to.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Locked Tonight</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>The File</strong><span>The new identity ran today. It made decisions. It moved the body. ON.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>The Body</strong><span>Carried the new file for a full day. Denied old reflexes. Now the body knows. ON.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>The Field</strong><span>The signal you broadcast reached people. The render has begun. ON.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-02-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
