+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Day 03 / Decide From the File</p>
+    <h1>Decide From the File</h1>
+    <p class="lede">Identity is not a feeling. Identity is a decision pattern. Same situation, two different decisions, two different timelines.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Decide From the File — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">DENIED stays active. Today you add FROM THE FILE — proactive, used before decisions.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Decide Command</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Before any decision today — small, medium, or large — pause for three seconds and run the command internally.</span><span><code>FROM THE FILE.</code></span><span>Then decide. Three seconds. Three words. The decision lands from the new operating layer instead of the old default.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Spoken Decision</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Three times today — when a decision matters — speak it out loud as you make it.</span><span><code>I'm sending this without rewriting it. / I'm declining this. No explanation. / I'm posting this now.</code></span><span>Speaking it commits the decision to air and body simultaneously. The body hears its own voice make the call.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Decision Log</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>By the end of Day 3, log five decisions where the new character chose differently than the old character would have.</span><span>Note the situation, what the old character would have decided, what you decided. The contrast is the point. Five entries. Logged by bedtime.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 03 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Commands</span><span class="status-value status-complete">DENIED + FROM THE FILE</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Morning Activation</p>
+    <h2>Identity Is What You Decide</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Re-state the renders, step forward, fire CONVICTION, begin the day.</p><p>The difference between the old and the new character is not your mood or language. The difference is by what you choose when a decision is in front of you. From which chair are you choosing?</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 03 — Morning Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-03-morning-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>The Data Lock</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Tonight is a data lock. The decisions you made today are not being remembered as moments. They are being logged as identity.</p><p>The body is learning from the pattern now, and the pattern is what starts deciding for you tomorrow.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 03 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-03-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Firewall</p>
+    <h2>When the Old File Sounds Reasonable</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The old file will visit today wearing reasonable clothing. It will tell you to slow down, ease up, be gentle, that you are being too intense. That is the old character's most sophisticated weapon.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Response</h3>
+      <p>If you find yourself reaching for a reasonable-sounding reason to skip a transmission, skip an operation, skip the protocol — run the DENIED command at full force, then run FROM THE FILE, then continue.</p><p>The reasonable voice is the voice you have been listening to for years. Today is the day it stops being able to win.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-03-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
