+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Day 04 / Field Operations</p>
+    <h1>Field Operations</h1>
+    <p class="lede">Not a sit-still day. The body is taught through posture, breath, pace, and field. Today the signal stops being thought and starts being walked.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Field Operations — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Today&#x27;s protocol operates on the field layer. Portals, claims, and field response.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Portal Open</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every time you cross a threshold today — a room, a conversation, a meeting, a store, a car, a call — pause for one breath and run the command internally.</span><span><code>PORTAL OPEN.</code></span><span>You are not entering a room. You are opening a portal in space and walking through it.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Threshold Claim</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Three times today, before walking into a space that matters, claim what you are doing to that space.</span><span><code>I walk into this room and the room reorganizes. / I am the current in this conversation. / What is mine is in this room. I am collecting it.</code></span><span>Active, not aspirational. State what your arrival is doing to the room.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Field Response Log</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>By bedtime, log five field responses. Look specifically for proof the fire was generating.</span><span>Money or resources landing. A door you walked through without permission. Someone matching your pace. An opportunity stacking bigger than expected. A timeline shift you can name.</span><span>These are not coincidences. These are the field returning the fire you generated.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 04 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Mode</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Walking Transmission</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Morning Activation</p>
+    <h2>Walk From Already Arrived</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Listen to this while walking. What follows are not suggestions — they are commands.</p><p>Walk as the new character. Walk as source itself. Walk knowing the world is rearranging around you. Every step opens a portal. Every step opens a door that was not there yesterday.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 04 — Morning Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-04-morning-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>Field Calibration</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Tonight is field calibration. Quiet. Clean. Mechanical. No overthinking, no effort.</p><p>The frequency adjusts, stabilizes, and locks while you stay inside it. The field has changed. The signal is holding. The day is sealed.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 04 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-04-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Reference</p>
+    <h2>Calibration Phases</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The evening transmission runs in four phases. Each phase moves the field one step further into lock.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Phases</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>Reception</strong><span>Field receiving.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Tuning</strong><span>The frequency is upgraded.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Stabilizing</strong><span>Signal stabilized. Render lag collapsed.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>Hold</strong><span>You are inside the field. The frequency is locked.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-04-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
+    </div>
