+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Day 05 / Already Done</p>
+    <h1>Already Done</h1>
+    <p class="lede">Not becoming. Not transition. Recognition. There is no future coming. What appears to be coming is already here.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Already Done — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Every operation today interrupts the body when it tries to chase, wait, or look for things &#x27;on the way&#x27;.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Already Done</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every time the body tries to chase an outcome — working toward, pushing for, hoping for, waiting for — run the command internally.</span><span><code>ALREADY DONE.</code></span><span>The firewall against the old prediction model. The outcome is already in the field. The body's job is not to produce it. The body's job is to stop blocking the recognition of it.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Past-Tense Voicing</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Three times today, speak one outcome aloud as if it has already happened. Past tense. As fact.</span><span><code>The deal closed. / The money landed. / The opportunity arrived. / The income shift happened.</code></span><span>The new file does not say <code>I will</code>. The new file says <code>It happened</code>. Because on this timeline, it did.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Recognition Log</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>By bedtime, log three moments today where something you assumed you had to wait for revealed itself as already here.</span><span>Not arrivals. Recognitions. Information already available. A resource already in your field. A capacity always there. A door that had never actually been closed.</span><span>Each recognition collapses the gap that the old prediction model was creating.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 05 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Mode</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Recognition Layer</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Morning Activation</p>
+    <h2>Identity Engineering Protocol</h2>
+    <p class="lede">This transmission is classified. File access granted. Re-Specify this morning, then move through the day from that position.</p><p>The render lag is not real. There is no delay built into reality — only delay built into perception. The new file expects instant. Therefore instant.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 05 — Morning Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-05-morning-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>Waiting Terminated</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Tonight terminates waiting. Not slowly. Not gently. Completely.</p><p>The version of you who has been waiting on outcomes, money, clarity, opportunity, or arrival does not get to keep running after this transmission.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 05 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-05-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Decryption</p>
+    <h2>Six Entries</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The morning transmission decrypts six entries from the operational truth file.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Entries</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>01</strong><span>Becoming is a slow path. It does not exist. There is only frequency shift followed by render.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>02</strong><span>You did not become the new character. You were already the new character running diagnostics.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>03</strong><span>The render lag is not real. The expectation dissolves, the lag dissolves with it.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>04</strong><span>Disregard the old prediction model. The new file expects instant. Therefore instant.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>05</strong><span>There is no future. What appears to be on the way has already arrived. Your job is to recognize.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>06</strong><span>You are not a person becoming someone. You are the timeline. Reality is the receipt.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-05-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
