+<main class="page-shell">
+  <section class="identity">
+    <p class="kicker">Day 06 / Operating From Source</p>
+    <h1>Operating From Source</h1>
+    <p class="lede">The final day. Identity is source code. Reality is render. Today the body practices being the new file rather than performing it.</p>
+    <div class="page-actions"><a href="../wormhole.html">Wormhole</a><a href="../index.html">Daily Run</a></div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel operation-card">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Operation</p>
+    <h2>Operating From Source — Three Operations</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Today the body practices operating from source — being the new file rather than performing it.</p>
+    <div class="sequence">
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">01</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Now</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Every time you catch the body slipping into anticipation, projection, or replay — run the command internally.</span><span><code>NOW.</code></span><span>One word. One beat. Returns the body to source operation.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">02</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Drop the Performance</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>Three times today, catch the performance and drop it.</span><span>Performance shows up in language — the hedging, the softening, the over-explaining, the apologizing, the qualifying. When you catch yourself about to add one, drop it.</span><span>Let the no stand without justification. Let the yes stand without hedging. Let the boundary land without apology.</span></span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="seq-row">
+        <span class="seq-index">03</span>
+        <span class="seq-label">Frequency Match Log</span>
+        <span class="seq-body"><span>By bedtime, log three frequency matches — moments where the field around you matched your level instead of pulling you down to its old level.</span><span>Someone responded to the new source. Someone moved at your pace. A conversation landed in one exchange instead of three. Someone deferred without negotiation.</span><span>These are render evidence. The source has been replaced. The render is following.</span></span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="status-strip">
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Status</span><span class="status-value status-active">Day 06 Active</span></div>
+      <div class="status-row"><span class="status-label">Source</span><span class="status-value status-complete">Replaced</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Morning Activation</p>
+    <h2>Identity Is Source Code</h2>
+    <p class="lede">State the renders, take the steps, fire CONVICTION.</p><p>Identity is not something you have — identity is the source code. Reality is the render. You cannot edit a video file by changing pixels on the screen. You change the source. The Wormhole replaces the source.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 06 — Morning Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-06-morning-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="panel">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Evening Activation</p>
+    <h2>Reality Control Panel</h2>
+    <p class="lede">Tonight the control panel opens. You are not here to ask reality for permission anymore. You are here to identify the old programs, terminate them, and run commands from the operator seat.</p><p>Clear what still pushes or performs, and build the statement that locks your field deeper while you sleep.</p>
+    <div class="media-block">
+      <p class="media-block__caption">Day 06 — Evening Activation</p>
+      <audio controls preload="metadata">
+        <source src="../assets/audio/wormhole/day-06-evening-activation.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
+      </audio>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="reference-section">
+    <p class="panel-kicker">Panel</p>
+    <h2>Force Quit · Execute · I AM</h2>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <p>The evening transmission opens the Reality Control Panel and runs three sequences.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Force Quit</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>01</strong><span><code>FORCE QUIT PUSHING.</code> The pattern that tries to force outcomes through effort.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>02</strong><span><code>FORCE QUIT PERFORMANCE.</code> The pattern that acts like the new character instead of being it.</span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>03</strong><span><code>FORCE QUIT CONVINCING.</code> The pattern that needs to justify, prove, and explain.</span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Execute</h3>
+      <div class="flat-list"><div class="flat-row"><strong>01</strong><span><code>EXECUTE: I am the source.</code></span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>02</strong><span><code>EXECUTE: Reality renders from me.</code></span></div><div class="flat-row"><strong>03</strong><span><code>EXECUTE: I command reality to bend.</code></span></div></div>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>I AM</h3>
+      <p>Build your I AM statement. Three parts: <strong>I AM</strong> + the frequency you operate from + what reality renders from you.</p><p>Speak it internally. Speak it out loud. Speak it slower. Then say <code>EXECUTE I AM</code>. Statement locked. Field sealed.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="ref-block">
+      <h3>Daily Card</h3>
+      <div class="page-actions"><a href="../assets/docs/wormhole/day-06-daily-card.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Daily Card ↗</a></div>
+    </div>
